{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">澳門改發三號風球，預料今日維持。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在氹仔，風力未見明顯增強，驟雨漸趨頻密。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">氣象局預料，紅霞明日凌晨至早上，將在澳門以東約170公里登陸，明日凌晨至早上改發八號風球可能性，是較低至中等。但明日會有大驟雨及雷暴，需提防水浸。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.M.TYPHOON-1800_003.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20266bzD0eZvJE1784986017.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.M.TYPHOON-1800_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.M.TYPHOON-1800_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20263VcpxNO4op1784979314.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.M.TYPHOON-1800_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-25T13:38:02.918019+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}